{"seq":21,"slug":"ai-refactoring-migration","title":"AI 辅助的重构与代码迁移","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-辅助的重构与代码迁移\">AI 辅助的重构与代码迁移</h1><p>绝大多数工程师的时间不是花在写新代码上，而是花在改既有代码上。改一个用了十年的支付模块、把一个 AngularJS 前端搬到 React、把项目从 Java 8 拖到 Java 21、给一堆过期依赖打补丁——这些活又脏又险，一旦改错代价巨大，所以历来推进缓慢。2026 年真正变化的不是「AI 会不会写代码」，而是 AI agent 能不能在不破坏行为的前提下，安全地、成规模地改造别人写的、自己也读不全的代码。这个 hub 就围绕这一件事展开。</p>\n<p>它的主线很清楚：先打地基，再讲手段，再落到具体迁移场景，最后收口到工程化的落地纪律。四章层层递进，谁也替代不了谁。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」回答三个前置问题：为什么重构这件事值得交给 AI、什么时候该重构而不是重写、以及在让 agent 动手之前必须先铺好的安全网。这一章不谈具体技术，只谈判断力和底线——没有可逆性和验证，后面所有手段都是在裸奔。</p>\n<p>第二章「技术手段」把改代码的方法分成三类：确定性的代码变换（codemod）、靠语言模型理解意图的语义级重构、以及以测试为标尺驱动的测试引导重构。三者不是互斥的选项，而是一条从「确定但死板」到「灵活但需校验」的光谱，工程上往往组合使用。</p>\n<p>第三章「迁移」把这些手段投到三个真实战场：框架迁移、语言迁移、依赖升级。它们规模不同、风险不同、可自动化程度也不同，但都共享同一套底层方法论，本章讲的是各自的特殊性。</p>\n<p>第四章「工程实践」是最后三道关卡：面对动辄上千万行、塞不进上下文窗口的大库该怎么切分推进；改完的代码怎么审、怎么验证行为等价；以及那些反复让团队栽跟头的陷阱与边界——幻觉、静默漂移、过度信任。把前三章的能力真正变成生产成果，靠的就是这一章的纪律。</p>\n<p>读法上，建议先通读第一章建立判断框架，再按需深入。每一篇都只深讲属于它的那个概念，遇到别处主讲的内容会用交叉链接指过去，整个 hub 是一张网，而不是十二座孤岛。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-ai-refactoring","title":"为什么用 AI 重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/foundations/why-ai-refactoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"refactoring-vs-rewrite","title":"重构与重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/foundations/refactoring-vs-rewrite"},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-nets","title":"安全网与可逆性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/foundations/safety-nets"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"技术手段","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"codemod-transforms","title":"代码变换与 codemod","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/techniques/codemod-transforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"semantic-refactoring","title":"语义级重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/techniques/semantic-refactoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"test-guided","title":"测试引导重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/techniques/test-guided"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration","title":"迁移","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/migration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"framework-migration","title":"框架迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/migration/framework-migration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-migration","title":"语言迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/migration/language-migration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-upgrades","title":"依赖升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/migration/dependency-upgrades"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"large-codebase-strategy","title":"大型代码库策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/practice/large-codebase-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"review-verification","title":"审查与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/practice/review-verification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-refactoring-migration/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}